            "process_md": "**Step 1:** The State Government/UT Administration identifies eligible villages.\n**Step 2:** A Village Development Plan (VDP) is prepared for selected villages.\n**Step 3:** The plan is approved at the district and state level.\n**Step 4:** Proposal is submitted to the Ministry Of Tribal Affairs.\n**Step 5:** Funds are released after approval.\n**Step 6:** Implementation is carried out by local authorities with monitoring mechanisms.\n<br>\n\n"
