          "eligibilityDescription_md": "> **General Eligibility**\n\n\n- The village must have at least 50% Scheduled Tribe (ST) population.\n- The village must have a population of at least 500 in plain areas; 250 in hilly/tribal areas.\n- The village must be selected by the State/UT Government based on criteria defined in the guidelines.\n\n> **Preference / Priority**\n\n\n- Preference is given to villages with higher ST population concentration.\n- Priority is given to villages with significant infrastructure gaps.\n\n<br>\n\n"
        },
